          "textHash": "438f0c32df8328ff82c4884f9db34c74fe7cc0c19871c078ecb8ab3357802263",
          "excerpt": "The Contractor shall provide information specified in 42 C.F.R. 438.10(g)(2)(XI) about the Enrollee Grievance and Appeal System to all service providers and Subcontractors at the time they enter a contract."
