          "excerpt": "The Contractor shall not require Providers to perform any treatment or procedure that is contrary to the Provider’s conscience, religious beliefs, or ethical principles in accordance with 42 C.F.R. 438.102. The Contractor shall have a referral process in place for situations wher"
