          "excerpt": "Pursuant to the Affordable Care Act and 42 C.F.R. 438.3(s), CMS requires States to collect CMS - 138 ATTACHMENT C - Medicaid Managed Care Contract and Appendices Docusign Envelope ID: 6A1145C6-6B8B-4411-98D3-27D59BA65F17 level rebates on all Medicaid MCO utilization. 1.A. The Con"
