          "excerpt": "The Contractor shall have arrangements, policies, and procedures that comply with all state and federal statutes and regulations, including 42 C.F.R. 438.608 and Section 6032 of the Federal Deficit Reduction Act of 2005, governing Fraud, Waste, and Abuse requirements. The Contrac"
