          "excerpt": "On or before the eighth (8 th ) day of each month during this Contract, the Department shall remit to the Contractor the Capitation Payment specified in Section 11.1 “Calculation of Capitation Payment Rates” (subject to approval of the rates by CMS) for each Enrollee determined t"
