          "excerpt": "The Contractor shall require, through Provider contract provision, that all Enrollees receiving inpatient Behavioral Health Services are scheduled for outpatient follow-up and/or continuing treatment prior to discharge. The outpatient treatment must occur within seven (7) Days fr"
