          "excerpt": "The Contractor must provide inpatient psychiatric services to Enrollees under the age of twenty-one (21) and over the age of sixty-five (65) who have been ordered to receive the services by a court of competent jurisdiction under the provisions of KRS 645 or KRS 202A. The Contrac"
