          "excerpt": "The Contractor shall demonstrate to the Department its compliance with NCQA/MBHO accreditation requirements, at a minimum, by meeting the following standards: 1.A. The availability of behavioral healthcare practitioners and providers within its network; 1.B. The development of pr"
